                  <paragraph>*when taken as directed, See Drug Facts Panel.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>†This product is not manufactured or distributed by Bayer Healthcare LLC, distributor of Claritin® 24 Hour.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">TAMPER EVIDENT: DO NOT USE IF PRINTED SAFETY SEAL UNDER CAP IS BROKEN OR MISSING</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">KEEP OUTER CARTON FOR COMPLETE WARNINGS AND PRODUCT INFORMATION</content>
